date-released: "2026-11-24"
abstract: "An AI agent wrote the weights of a neural cellular automaton that solves mazes, with no training, no data and no gradient. 115 of its 1,458 numbers are non-zero. Every cell sees only its 3 × 3 neighbourhood, and the cells mark every shortest path from the start to the goal, exactly."
